    "description": "MOTIVATED SELLER !! Acepting Offers Sun-Filled Top-Floor Gem in the Heart of Park Slope Welcome home to this exceptionally bright and uniquely charming two-bedroom apartment nestled in the very heart of Park Slope. Perched on the top floor with soaring 12-foot ceilings, this home is flooded with natural light from skylights in every room—so much so, you may find yourself reaching for your sunglasses indoors. From the moment you enter, you’re greeted by an incredible sense of openness, warmth, and light. The open-concept kitchen flows seamlessly into the spacious living area, creating the perfect setting for both entertaining and everyday living. There’s ample room for a full dining table, while the kitchen features a gas oven/stovetop, dishwasher, and generous cabinet storage. ( Kitchen and bathroom need updating ) Cozy up beside the working fireplace on crisp evenings or unwind while taking in charming city skyline views from your sun-drenched living room year-round. Both bedrooms comfortably accommodate queen-size beds along with additional furniture, and the apartment offers abundant closet space throughout to keep everything organized and clutter-free. Located just moments from Prospect Park, it practically feels like your own backyard, this unbeatable location places you in the center of everything that makes Park Slope one of Brooklyn’s most beloved neighborhoods: tree-lined streets, charming cafés, renowned schools, boutique shopping, and an unmatched neighborhood atmosphere. Additional highlights include: • Laundry in the building • Top-floor privacy • Investor and end-user friendly Whether you’re searching for your forever home, or a strong investment opportunity in one of Brooklyn’s most sought-after neighborhoods, this is a rare offering you won’t want to miss. All offers are welcome. Call or text today to schedule your private viewing—opportunities like this don’t come around often. Let’s make this home yours.",
